  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "offset": "BLUE_SETUMEI",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> It is a member of the Brutes.\n> He is in human form, so he must\nhave been killed before he could\ntransform.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "offset": "BLUE_KANSOU_G",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "They must have fallen by Lupa's\nhand. The corpses show no apparent\ndamage. His technique is brilliant.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "offset": "BLUE_KANSOU_H",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What? Is he too good to eat these\nguys? I'm sick of that showoff.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "offset": "AREA_04_2BANTAI_YATTA",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "The Embryon...!\nI see. Those damn Wolves are\nallying with you to attack Ajna.\nDon't underestimate us!",
