    {
      "id": 24,
      "offset": "AREA_09_END",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> It became quiet...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "offset": "AREA_DEATH2",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> It is a member of the Brutes.\n> The body was mercilessly torn\nto pieces and left for dead.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "offset": "AREA_10_NPC",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "You're the Embryon, right?\nLupa passed by here...\nHe growled at me like he didn't\nremember who I was.\nMaybe it's just dark in here...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "offset": "KYOUSEI_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "This is great. All we gotta do is\nkill them and that crazy dog dude.\nThen we win, bro!\nIt won't be a problem.\nWe'll send the other guy, later...\n...Send him to our stomachs!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "offset": "DEAD_BLUE03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> It is a member of the Brutes.\n> His body is in shreds.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "offset": "KANSOU_GEIRU",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "This must be one of the Brutes'\nofficers.\nIt appears he was run down and\nthen mutilated. He must have been\ntortured before finally dying.\nJudging from the wounds, this was\ndone by something very large.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "offset": "KANSOU_ARUJI",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What a way to die...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "offset": "KANSOU_CIE",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Whoa... He's completely ripped apart.\nMon, mebbe dere be something\ndown here besides us and Lupa, ja?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "offset": "AREA_22_1BANTAI_KILL",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Wh-What's going on?\nNo-don't...\nYEEAarrgghh!!",
