    {
      "id": 46,
      "offset": "gale_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Serph...\nHumans have a premature form\nduring development, roughly\nbetween 4 and 15 years of age...\nCan you remember the term\nfor this?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "offset": "gale_001_01_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It's a child.\nA kid...?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "offset": "gale_001_01_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "That's correct--a child.\nWhy didn't we notice this before?\nLupa was right, there are only\nfully adult humans here.\nHis words may lead us to the truth.\nCome on, we need to hurry.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "offset": "gale_001_01_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Serph, kid is the term for the\nmaturing stage of a goat.\nThink more carefully.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "offset": "ciero_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "A child is like... a kid, ja?\nLike a little guy... dis big?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
